  <item>
    <title>4.“我是重轻，我买相机”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66de52cfbfd7110df436850a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66de52cfbfd7110df436850a</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 09 Sep 2024 01:43:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>时间轴</span></h2><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="287">04:47</a> </span></strong><span>当微单不再为拍照而存在</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="408">06:48</a> </span></strong><span>一个人买50个镜头的理由</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="502">08:22</a> </span></strong><span>性能不好变成了一种风格</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="679">11:19</a></span></strong><span> 我只捡500块钱以下的镜头垃圾</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1294">21:34</a></span></strong><span> 挣男的钱可太难了</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1983">33:03</a></span></strong><span> 不拍照片的人才养活了那么多相机品牌</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2135">35:35</a></span></strong><span> 我们其实在假生产真消费</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2410">40:10</a> </span></strong><span>我们真的能通过消费成为更好的自己吗</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3154">52:34</a> </span></strong><span>那些溢出的需求与功能</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3364">56:04</a> </span></strong><span>我害怕接近徕卡</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3664">1:01:04</a> </span></strong><span>G大师是一个营销产物</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3723">1:02:03</a> </span></strong><span>品牌的矩阵是一个迷宫</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4015">1:06:55</a> </span></strong><span>我们只是享受一种主动的感觉</span></p><span></span><h2><span>聊天的人</span></h2><span></span><p><span>重轻：只买不（怎么）拍的相机爱好者</span></p><span></span><p><span>小白免：塑料小人爱好者</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿页：玩具流水线工人</span></p><span></span><h2><span>重轻的相机和镜头：</span></h2><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpJorhzzQqSSUOsblS_WPw6_8zrR.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FleR2ucZosBI_PmfBjU1492FlMUZ.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpLYvQK2BaqNs0zL4QIzPciwsUAq.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjDgAfsi5ktSp5eL01gu-2K_sqJX.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lmjfbzkgDrKhMTcEIRKTIitgUN_7.m4a" length="85051415" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:10:12</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvY3y9w38G-t92Ys7pheOGlWr-vI.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>4</itunes:episode>
