  </item>
  <item>
    <title>3.五十万买个塑料娃？BJD为啥这么上头？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66b18dc833ddcbb53c954150</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66b18dc833ddcbb53c954150</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 06 Aug 2024 02:43:20 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>时间轴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="55">00:55</a> BJD是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="205">03:25</a> 哪个BJD的尺寸更适合我？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="295">04:55</a> 组一个基本的BJD娃娃需要多少钱？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="453">07:33</a> 竟然可以换脸的小布</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="795">13:15</a> 买盗版娃你就完蛋了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1288">21:28</a> 我想把老公复刻下来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1635">27:15</a> BJD的入门门槛其实没那么高</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2417">40:17</a> 重要的是投入的真心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2499">41:39</a> 互助流水线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2680">44:40</a> 进来割韭菜的机构</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3035">50:35</a> i人怎么入坑？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3324">55:24</a> 我等了定制的cos服等了一年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3572">59:32</a> 外部对于BJD圈的误解</span></p><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><p><span>聊天的人</span></p><span></span><p><span>小白免：塑料小人爱好者</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿页：玩具流水线工人</span></p><span></span><p><span>附图</span></p><span></span><p><span>小尺寸BJD一览</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FulgFU7v1TmhGUJlQQ6KwadQpT2s.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>娃展上遇到养得很好的初音未来</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsByFx-SBZggbKTNpT07ZTqkqyU9.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>小白免的娃</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpZgOD2AFzujeuHTk4OciCvSwPM1.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>小白免的六分cos娃（妆和眼珠子都是自己做哒</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnQh37KNwteYY9_lYp1v7k8uVAaP.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>小白免的六分cos娃（妆和眼珠子都是自己做哒</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqKOQWWTnfktkn_KQZ_0sp6KQam6.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>小白免最近get的做衣服技能</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FstaI6ckE4-FuvUawUVaxrUQXifH.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>3分叔体真的很大！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjoJgNecbTZxrEb6PAGkoRZ6U40j.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>表舅你是一颗卤蛋</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft3sQ9achaDJhznXU0o1vR25mEW7.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>一个人出门太危险了，带上这个十二分柯南吧</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuUkL3Z7tvc53mZlJM0OMB9erxlf.jpeg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lsnVWjfKeeHFu7i8tLnX2mYwzM8N.m4a" length="77850665" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:04:16</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvY3y9w38G-t92Ys7pheOGlWr-vI.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>3</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>2.还有人买潮玩吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6699f3ba37236c546e3cef39</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6699f3ba37236c546e3cef39</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 19 Jul 2024 05:03:53 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>时间轴</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="107">01:47</a> 说出潮玩那两个字的时候你就不潮流了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="313">05:13</a> 潮玩的内部运作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="571">09:31</a> 每一个人都是粉丝，每一个人都是黄牛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1264">21:04</a> 销量有了，溢价没了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1311">21:51</a> 这个行业做的是关于信心的生意</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1538">25:38</a> 泡泡玛特在抢谁的生意</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2236">37:16</a> 什么样的潮玩IP有潜力？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2483">41:23</a> 那些短线收割的IP</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2995">49:55</a> 那些卖不掉的玩具可能有更多的情感价值</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3263">54:23</a> 只有和黄牛打交道才能买到玩具</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3489">58:09</a> 拆盲盒拆到工伤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3902">1:05:02</a> 没有野心的创作者无法在潮玩这个领域成功</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4770">1:19:30</a> “我真的喜欢什么？”是一个永久性的提问</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5250">1:27:30</a> 收藏玩具的下一步是去创作自己的玩具</span></p><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><h2><span>本期梗概</span></h2><span></span><p><span>想聊聊作为玩具爱好者阶段的自己和作为玩具从业者的不同，从收藏玩具到创造玩具，这个行业充满了各种意外，有些让我们以为自己很厉害，有些让我们受伤害，依然热爱玩具，但是我们的选择会有所不同。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>聊天的人</span></h2><span></span><p><span>小白免：塑料小人爱好者</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿页：玩具流水线工人</span></p><span></span><h2><span>提到的玩具</span></h2><span></span><p><span>Lee Hu “Tiger” By 小川耕平</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjY-PX9gnKi0S_10NGMPRjSO4BB6.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Last Day of Winter By Amanda Visell</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlsZO-m85tEsHGXX0uefoF0jDYha.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Target - Mechanics of Life By Luke Chueh</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvwxfWnjvcO88aZo7Y-4GtDdL6aw.webp"></figure><span></span><p><span>Make a Wish By 朱玲</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/luMicFrNFKc8eGetGahM9j0rIu5V.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>阿页的一些玩具</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs-DtzHcuHDqfqQVV19IeLMedKPn.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkTWvfKJMm_1rcYLWsnLVyN-3YOj.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lngRPWoRAa8KLo-DlFIXslEqhrrW.m4a" length="111007791" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:31:38</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvY3y9w38G-t92Ys7pheOGlWr-vI.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>2</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>1.好想买艺术绘本啊啊啊</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/669397d28fcadceb90327170</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">669397d28fcadceb90327170</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 14 Jul 2024 09:18:09 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>时间轴</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="203">03:23</a> 什么是艺术绘本？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="293">04:53</a> 为什么艺术绘本那么少？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="719">11:59</a> 怎么理解奖项与艺术绘本的关系？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="908">15:08</a> 去哪里找到喜欢的艺术绘本</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1099">18:19</a> 为什么推荐《Through a Life》和《Kingdom》这两部绘本</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1521">25:21</a> 看艺术绘本的都是哪些人？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1875">31:15</a> 某些艺术绘本完全是卖方市场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2027">33:47</a> Zine 记录了那些从未被关注的小事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2104">35:04</a> Noritake与我是白的像与不像</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2854">47:34</a> 平面艺术是力所能及的艺术</span></p><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><h2><span>聊天的人</span></h2><span></span><p><span>小白免：塑料小人爱好者</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿页：玩具流水线工人</span></p><span></span><h2><span>本期梗概</span></h2><span></span><p><span>这一期录于20年，也就是4年前，我们尝试在那个节点去探讨一下艺术绘本作为一个阅读品类的现状，以及私人角度的阅读体验与观察。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>提到的绘本和作者</span></h2><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvR7gTqBQgvmQIwA_LeHoz1TcCaE.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>《Through a Life》Tom Haugomat 以上为英版</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkqlHVCpDYvnj-5EZgwWPfoCWkIi.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>法语版《À travers》 封面有特别的镂空设计 收藏首选</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkpf5u0OXlXJuBTrlQD_4OhbjaEU.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>《Kingdom》Jon McNaught</span></p><span></span><h2><span>提到的书店</span></h2><span></span><p><span>北京 木鸟漫画</span></p><span></span><p><span>上海 香蕉鱼书店</span></p><span></span><p><span>（这里怎么没有赞赏按钮）</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lsVKK4EO7NI_necN7IKINkzAl95L.m4a" length="63364609" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:52:18</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvY3y9w38G-t92Ys7pheOGlWr-vI.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>1</itunes:episode>
